COMMON={
'bullets':[
'True Shadow Monarch adds a level 100 system, stat points, class trees, weapons, a shop and six Shadow slots. It evolves from Song Jinwu and Igros through a Player Quest.',
'Shadow Army lets you level Shadows from takedowns. Defeat a boss you own, then use Arise to recruit a custom Shadow with a random passive.',
'Memoria Maker fuses one base Memoria with two donors. Test the recipe in Unit Sandbox before using a daily Memoria Puzzle Piece.',
'Fourteen Vanguard Familiars add unit-specific effects. New content also includes Returned Dungeon, The First Commander, Shadow Trials, Card Battle and a six-world Apostles Vs Vanguards campaign.',
'The UI is rebuilt with Quick Actions, a searchable Codex, new profiles, stage portals, controller/mobile improvements, Auto Summon and match pause.'],
'steps':[
'Build a small plan for the Monarch: level the system with takedowns, unlock Shadow slots and try one class tree before buying many items.',
'For Returned Dungeon, choose statue awakenings carefully. Each awakened statue makes later enemies stronger but increases rewards; the last statue sets the wave 20 boss.',
'For The First Commander, plan troops before waves. Units deal half damage, while Goblins, Hobgoblins, Lizardmen, Lycans and Wolfmen provide different perks.',
'For Shadow Trials, equip three of nine abilities, learn the seven trials and use gates and relics to improve the run.',
'For Card Battle, build a 20-card deck around a captain. Start with bots to learn the three-hitpoint and energy rules.',
'Use the Codex search and Quick Actions to find new stages, passives and shops without searching through old menus.'],
'ugbul':[
'Run a compatible Android game in the cloud to reduce local phone storage, battery and hardware load during long farming or testing sessions.',
'Remote access makes it easier to return to a session and check progress between activities. Cloud hosting does not play the game automatically.',
'If you use more than one account or device, separate cloud instances may help organize repeated checks where the game allows it. Test compatibility, connection and server node first.']
}

